/*
 * Implements semantic validation for array indexing and slicing in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Validate integer indexing on fixed-size arrays.
 *   - Validate range indexing(slicing) when allowed.
 *   - Perform compile-time bounds checking when possible.
 *   - Insert runtime bounds checks when necessary.
 *   - Construct ArrayAccessValue, SliceCtorValue, or ArrayValue depending
 *     on the indexing mode.
 *   - Enforce unsafe-context restrictions for pointer arithmetic.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::index::array
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/index/array.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-30
